<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
    <title>Bienvenue</title>
    <style>
        body.email-body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #fbf7f0;
            font-family: "Hind Madurai", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .email-preheader {
            display: none !important;
            visibility: hidden;
            opacity: 0;
            height: 0;
            width: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .email-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background: #fbf7f0;
        }
        .email-wrapper-cell {
            padding: 24px 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .email-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 14px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(15, 20, 17, 0.08);
            border-collapse: collapse;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .email-hero {
            background: #1f5e3b;
            padding: 28px;
        }
        .email-hero-title {
            margin: 0;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: "Montserrat", Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .email-hero-sub {
            margin: 8px 0 0;
            color: #dfe9e2;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .email-content {
            padding: 28px;
        }
        .email-text {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            color: #0f1411;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .email-text--spaced {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .email-cta-table {
            margin: 16px 0 22px;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .email-cta-cell {
            background: #C9A227;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .email-cta {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 22px;
            color: #0f1411;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .email-cta-secondary {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            color: #1f5e3b;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 13px;
            border: 1px solid #1f5e3b;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        .email-cta-secondary-cell {
            text-align: center;
        }
        .email-spacer {
            height: 10px;
            line-height: 10px;
            font-size: 0;
        }
        .email-section-title {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            color: #0f1411;
            font-family: "Montserrat", Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .email-panel {
            background: #fbf7f0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
        }
        .email-list {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0 0 0 16px;
            color: #0f1411;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .email-list-item {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
        }
        .email-help {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            color: #0f1411;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .email-link {
            color: #1f5e3b;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .email-muted {
            margin: 24px 0 0;
            color: #7a8c7a;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .email-footer {
            background: #f4efe6;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            color: #7a8c7a;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="email-body">
<span class="email-preheader">
    Bienvenue sur {{ appName }} - ton compte est pret.
</span>

<table role="presentation" class="email-wrapper">
    <tr>
        <td class="email-wrapper-cell">
            <table role="presentation" class="email-container">
                <tr>
                    <td class="email-hero">
                        <h1 class="email-hero-title">
                            Bienvenue sur {{ appName }}
                        </h1>
                        <p class="email-hero-sub">
                            Des menus gourmands, simples et rapides a commander.
                        </p>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                    <td class="email-content">
                        <p class="email-text">
                            Salut {{ firstName }},
                        </p>
                        <p class="email-text email-text--spaced">
                            Merci pour ton inscription. Ton compte est pret : tu peux te connecter et commencer a commander.
                        </p>

                        <table role="presentation" class="email-cta-table">
                            <tr>
                                <td class="email-cta-cell">
                                    <a class="email-cta" href="{{ url('app_login') }}">
                                        Se connecter
                                    </a>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr><td class="email-spacer"></td></tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td class="email-cta-secondary-cell">
                                    <a class="email-cta-secondary" href="{{ url('app_menu_index') }}">
                                        Voir les menus
                                    </a>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <div class="email-panel">
                            <h2 class="email-section-title">Pour bien demarrer</h2>
                            <ul class="email-list">
                                <li class="email-list-item">Choisis un menu qui te fait envie.</li>
                                <li class="email-list-item">Selectionne la date et le nombre de personnes.</li>
                                <li class="email-list-item">Valide, on s&#039;occupe du reste.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="email-panel">
                            <h2 class="email-section-title">Pourquoi {{ appName }} ?</h2>
                            <ul class="email-list">
                                <li class="email-list-item">Menus frais, gouts simples et gourmands.</li>
                                <li class="email-list-item">Commande rapide, livraison sans prise de tete.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <p class="email-help">
                            Besoin d&rsquo;aide ? <a class="email-link" href="{{ url('app_contact_index') }}">Contacte-nous</a>, on repond vite.
                        </p>

                        <p class="email-text">
                            Tu peux modifier tes infos de profil a tout moment.
                        </p>

                        <p class="email-muted">
                            Si tu n&rsquo;es pas a l&rsquo;origine de cette inscription, ignore simplement ce message.
                        </p>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                    <td class="email-footer">
                        {{ appName }} &middot; <a class="email-link" href="{{ url('app_contact_index') }}">Contact</a>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
